{"sections":[{"slug":"语法范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"语法范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">语法范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"语法范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">语法范畴是一个理论的</span> “"},{"Local":{"url":"/游走","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">游走</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的模型</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">所在的范畴</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">广义地说</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">任何一个范畴都可以视为某种理论的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">语法范畴</span>”, <span lang=\"zh\">而该范畴出发的保持结构的函子则可视为该理论的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">模型</span>”, <span lang=\"zh\">这种称呼只是视角的选择</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">我们将语法范畴理解为根据</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/语法–语义对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">语法</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">生成的结构</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Lawvere理论","text":"Lawvere <span lang=\"zh\">理论</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的语法范畴是一个对象生成的有限积范畴</span>.</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/PROP","text":"PROP"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">是一个对象生成的对称幺半范畴</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/语法–语义对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">语法</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">语义对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}